#: includes/class-privacy.php:194
msgid "We use a self-hosted, privacy-friendly analytics tool to understand how our website is used. It does not use cookies or similar technologies, does not store your IP address, and does not create profiles across websites or over time."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-privacy.php:195
msgid "To count unique visitors, a one-way hash of your IP address and browser user agent is combined with a secret that changes regularly; old secrets are deleted, so the hash cannot be linked back to you. We record the pages you visit, how long they are in view and how far you scroll, the referring website or campaign, your approximate location, your device, browser and operating system type, and the kind of network you visit from: for example a home connection, a mobile network, or the network of a company or organisation, whose name we may record. To tell people from automated traffic, your browser may solve a small computational puzzle in the background."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-privacy.php:196
msgid "The data is stored on our own servers, is never shared with third parties and is deleted automatically after a limited period. Browsers that send a Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control signal are not tracked."
msgstr ""

